        "text": "According to Petitioners (Dept. of Justice), according to Petitioners (Dept. of Justice), petitioners argue that the Federal Food, Drug, and Cosmetic Act requires a new drug to be proven safe and effective by the FDA before it can be marketed."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioners (Dept. of Justice)",
